---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us and Editorial Testing Standards | Holiday Gift Hub"
  description="Learn about Holiday Gift Hub's testing philosophy, holiday gift curation process, and our editorial team."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-700 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
      Our Philosophy
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">About Holiday Gift Hub</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
        Every holiday season, millions of shoppers waste hours scrolling through generic "top gift" lists stuffed with overpriced, out-of-stock items. <strong>Holiday Gift Hub</strong> was founded to solve gift-giving paralysis with tested, genuinely entertaining, and budget-friendly picks that arrive on time.
      </p>

      <section class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm my-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Our 4-Point Curation Standard</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Strict Price Verification:</strong> Every guide has hard budget caps ($15, £10, $25) that we verify continuously against live retail prices.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Verified Customer Sentiment:</strong> We only recommend products maintaining an average of 4.5+ stars across hundreds of verified customer reviews.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Prime 2-Day Shipping Reliability:</strong> We prioritize items fulfilled by Amazon Prime with fast 2-day delivery across both the US and UK.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold text-base">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Instant Digital Fallbacks:</strong> For shoppers who miss physical shipping deadlines, we provide free instant-print PDF party games and questionnaires.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Editorial Independence and Affiliate Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          We are 100% reader-supported. We never accept payment to feature a product on our gift lists. When you make a purchase through our verified Amazon links, we may earn an affiliate commission at no extra cost to you. Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure" class="text-red-700 underline font-semibold">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
